# Updating project & task management plans

When you add, change, or ship **project tasks**, **project detail**, **Kanban**, or related **Skaftin `project_tasks`** behaviour:

## 1. Rolling progress log (required)

Edit **[docs/plans/project-task-management/PROGRESS.md](../../docs/plans/project-task-management/PROGRESS.md)**:

- Bump the **Last reviewed** date if material work changed.
- Update the **Summary** table (phase status: Done / Mostly done / Not started / Planning).
- Add a **Changelog** bullet with date: what shipped or what gap was closed.
- Adjust **Next actions** so the queue matches reality.

## 2. Phase spec checklists (required when a phase moves)

Open the matching **[docs/plans/project-task-management/phase-*.md](../../docs/plans/project-task-management/)** file(s):

- Set **`Status:`** line at the top (e.g. Done, Mostly done, Not started).
- Tick **`[x]`** / leave **`[ ]`** on deliverables to match the codebase.
- If scope moved (e.g. list + board shipped on one page), say so in the phase doc so the written plan matches implementation.

## 3. Hub and indexes (when scope or status shifts)

- **[docs/plans/project-task-management/README.md](../../docs/plans/project-task-management/README.md)** — phase table **Status** column should match PROGRESS.
- **[docs/plans/README.md](../../docs/plans/README.md)** — keep the row pointing at the hub + progress log accurate.
- **[docs/README.md](../../docs/README.md)** — if new module docs were added, link them.

## 4. Schema and module docs (when DB or API contract changes)

- **[docs/03-database/project-tasks-schema-contract.md](../../docs/03-database/project-tasks-schema-contract.md)** and **[docs/03-database/sql/project-tasks.sql](../../docs/03-database/sql/project-tasks.sql)** — update when columns, constraints, or indexes change; re-run **Skaftin MCP** (`list_tables`, `get_table_schema`) when possible before editing shapes.
- **[docs/02-modules/project-tasks.md](../../docs/02-modules/project-tasks.md)** — routes, UI entry points, and service overview.

## 5. Do not edit by default

- Do **not** change **[docs/plans/README.md](../../docs/plans/README.md)** vision sections (long roadmap narrative) unless the product vision itself changed.
- Do **not** edit auto-generated **`.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`** snapshot files from the IDE; the repo source of truth is **`docs/plans/project-task-management/`**.

## Quick checklist before merging PM work

- [ ] PROGRESS.md updated (summary + changelog).
- [ ] Relevant `phase-*.md` deliverables / status lines updated.
- [ ] Hub README phase table aligned.
- [ ] Schema or `docs/02-modules/project-tasks.md` touched if behaviour or routes changed.
